## 🔍 SweetAlert2 API Reference

### **Basic Alert:**

```javascript
Swal.fire({
    icon: 'error',
    title: 'Lỗi!',
    text: 'Nội dung lỗi',
    confirmButtonColor: '#dc3545'
});
```

---

### **Confirmation Dialog:**

```javascript
Swal.fire({
    icon: 'warning',
    title: 'Xác nhận',
    text: 'Bạn có chắc chắn?',
    showCancelButton: true,
    confirmButtonColor: '#3b82f6',
    cancelButtonColor: '#6b7280',
    confirmButtonText: 'Xác nhận',
    cancelButtonText: 'Hủy'
}).then((result) => {
    if (result.isConfirmed) {
        // User confirmed
    }
});
```

---

### **HTML Content:**

```javascript
Swal.fire({
    icon: 'error',
    title: 'Lỗi validation',
    html: '<p>Lỗi 1</p><p>Lỗi 2</p>',
    confirmButtonColor: '#dc3545'
});
```

---

### **Success Message:**

```javascript
Swal.fire({
    icon: 'success',
    title: 'Thành công!',
    text: 'Thao tác đã hoàn tất',
    confirmButtonColor: '#28a745'
});
```

