## 📝 Best Practices

### **1. Use Appropriate Icons:**

- **error** - For errors and failures
- **warning** - For warnings and confirmations
- **success** - For success messages
- **info** - For information
- **question** - For questions

### **2. Keep Messages Clear:**

```javascript
// ✅ Good
Swal.fire({
    icon: 'error',
    title: 'Lỗi!',
    text: 'Email không đúng định dạng'
});

// ❌ Bad
Swal.fire('Error', 'Invalid email', 'error');
```

### **3. Use HTML for Complex Content:**

```javascript
// ✅ Good for multiple errors
Swal.fire({
    icon: 'error',
    title: 'Lỗi validation',
    html: '<ul><li>Lỗi 1</li><li>Lỗi 2</li></ul>'
});
```

### **4. Handle Promises:**

```javascript
// ✅ Good
Swal.fire({ ... }).then((result) => {
    if (result.isConfirmed) {
        // Handle confirmation
    }
});

// ❌ Bad (no handling)
Swal.fire({ ... });
// Code continues immediately
```

